        "TileImage": "$($repository 80a44a5a-a923-4026-83c3-6c582123f2f5).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47, and welcome back to Haven island. Today&apos;s targets are known for their green image and being nature protectors. But in reality, they are digging for oil in secret tunnels on land they don&apos;t own, and destroying nature. The targets names are Alexis White and Adam Crest. Adam is the CEO and the official inventor of the whole thing. You can find him lounging and vacationing on his own island while RP strategist and operations manager Alexis is in the tunnels doing the work. Have fun!",
